Tracked only so that web/public/ survives a clone.

Git cannot track an empty directory, and the one thing that lives here — coc/, the
game art — is gitignored, so without this file a fresh clone has no web/public at
all. A deploy then fails at the point where the art is copied in, with a bare
"No such file" from scp and nothing to say why.

What belongs in coc/, where each part comes from, and why none of it is in the
repository: see deploy/README.md.
